---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Welcome to Khao Sok Riverside Cottages"
  description="Welcome to Riverside Cottages. Find useful information to help you maximize your time in Khao Sok, and Riverside Cottages."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/home-slider-b.jpg"
  heroTitle="Welcome to Khao Sok Riverside Cottages"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Welcome", "href": "/welcome/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok Riverside Cottages</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Thank you for your interest in Khao Sok Riverside Cottages.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Please follow the links to continue your journey through the website.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Book a Package</span>
        </h2>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/home-slider-b.jpg"
            alt="Beautiful sunset on the lake"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Beautiful sunset on the lake</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For the very best value, book a package to include all your accommodation as well as exciting activities. Our tours are carefully selected to provide the very best that Khao Sok has to offer. As one of the first hospitality businesses in the area we have extensive knowledge of the best places to stay and the best things to do.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Book a Room</span>
        </h2>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/accommodation-top-back-opt.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok Hotel"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok Hotel</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For best value we encourage you to view our packages but if you are only looking for a room you've come to the right place. Our rooms are set along the River Sok or set in amongst the jungle a few hundred meters from the river.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Whichever you chose you are guaranteed a clean comfortable bungalow. They all feature:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>a spacious interior</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>private deck overlooking the jungle</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>new mattress and fresh linens</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>reliable WiFi internet</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>high-powered fans and mosquito nets</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>How to get to Khao Sok</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Get to Khao Sok from Phuket, Krabi, or Surat Thani. We are ideally located between Southern Thailand’s main travel destinations. There are a number of ways to get here:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Khao Sok map</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Private transfer</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Arriving by air</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Public transport</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Driving instructions</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Visit Our Blog</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          For a wealth of information about the place we love please browse our blog.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/best-activities-in-khao-sok-rivers-and-lakes-a-personal-review/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors"><img decoding="async" width="1600" height="1067" class="lazyload wp-image-12374" src="https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-activities-in-khao-sok-cover.jpg" data-orig-src="https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-activities-in-khao-sok-cover.jpg" alt="Best activities in Khao Sok" srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%271600%27%20height%3D%271067%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%201600%201067%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%271600%27%20height%3D%271067%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" data-srcset="https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-activities-in-khao-sok-cover-200x133.jpg 200w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-activities-in-khao-sok-cover-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-activities-in-khao-sok-cover-600x400.jpg 600w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-activities-in-khao-sok-cover-800x533.jpg 800w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-activities-in-khao-sok-cover-1200x800.jpg 1200w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/best-activities-in-khao-sok-cover.jpg 1600w" data-sizes="auto" data-orig-sizes="(max-width: 1146px) 100vw, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 800px" /></a><a href="/best-activities-in-khao-sok-rivers-and-lakes-a-personal-review/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok Playground – Rivers and Lakes – A Personal Review</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/guide-to-khao-sok-village/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors"><img decoding="async" width="1152" height="768" class="lazyload wp-image-4311" src="https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village-2.jpg" data-orig-src="https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village-2.jpg" alt="Khao Sok village" srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%271152%27%20height%3D%27768%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%201152%20768%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%271152%27%20height%3D%27768%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" data-srcset="https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village-2-200x133.jpg 200w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village-2-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village-2-600x400.jpg 600w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village-2-800x533.jpg 800w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Khao-Sok-village-2.jpg 1152w" data-sizes="auto" data-orig-sizes="(max-width: 1146px) 100vw, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 800px" /></a><a href="/guide-to-khao-sok-village/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">A Guide to Khao Sok Village</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/top-6-activities-in-khao-sok/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors"><img decoding="async" width="1048" height="698" class="lazyload wp-image-2356" src="https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Insta-81-e1711712547849.jpg" data-orig-src="https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Insta-81-e1711712547849.jpg" alt="khao sok national park activities - Full Day Lake Trip at Khao Sok" srcset="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%271048%27%20height%3D%27698%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%201048%20698%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%271048%27%20height%3D%27698%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" data-srcset="https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Insta-81-e1711712547849-200x133.jpg 200w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Insta-81-e1711712547849-400x266.jpg 400w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Insta-81-e1711712547849-600x400.jpg 600w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Insta-81-e1711712547849-800x533.jpg 800w, https://www.khao-sok-riverside-cottages.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/02/Insta-81-e1711712547849.jpg 1048w" data-sizes="auto" data-orig-sizes="(max-width: 1146px) 100vw, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 800px" /></a><a href="/top-6-activities-in-khao-sok/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Top 6 things to do in Khao Sok National Park</a></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Blog Categories</span>
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/category/khao-sok-national-park-thailand/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">The National Park</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/category/khao-sok-activities/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Activities</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/category/khao-sok-village/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok Village</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/category/riverside-cottages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Riverside Cottages</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/category/khao-sok-travel-information/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Travel Information</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/category/uncategorized/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Everything Else</a></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Activities</span>
        </h2>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/khao-sok-jungle-tour.jpg"
            alt="Jumping into Khao Sok lake"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Jumping into Khao Sok lake</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Our activities fall into 4 categories:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">hiking and trekking</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">lake trips</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-adventures/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">local adventures</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-culture/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Thai culture</a></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          for the best deals check out our <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">packages</a>.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Facilities at Khao Sok Riverside Cottages</span>
        </h2>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Front-Desk-2.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok riverside resort front desk"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok riverside resort front desk</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Facilities include:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Tour and Activities Desk</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>English-speaking staff</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Restaurant and bar</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Free Wi-fi at restaurant</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Laundry Service</span>
          </li>
